          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara epar tic mi rieko, kara etim ku mola ma kwar, man ku mola ma tar, man ku mola, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man mi tong’o kidi mir amwona, man mi ng’iko yen, kara etim i tic ceke mi bodho ma kwonde tung’ tung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eketho i adundene nia eponj, en ku Aholiab, ma wod Ahisamak, mi suru pa Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epong’o joni ku rieko mir adunde, kara gitim tic mi bodho ma kwonde tung’ tung’, mi ng’iko, man pa jabodho ma riek, man pa jakwoc mi ruko, i gin m’ulweku, man i m’uluga, i ma kwar ngbo de, man i bongu ma nwang’ ma ber, man pa jacwibongu, en e mi ju m’utimo tic mi bodho moko, man mi ju ma paru tic mi rieko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.35"
            ]
          }
